<title>UK: Vibroplant buys Instant Tool Hire.</title>
<headline>Vibroplant buys Instant Tool Hire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British plant hire firm Vibroplant Plc said on Monday it had bought British company Instant Tool Hire Ltd for an initial price of 950,000 stg cash.</p>
<p>Vibroplant said the price would be reduced if Instant Tool's pre-tax profit for the year to March 31 fell below expectations.</p>
<p>Further payments up to a maximum 1.2 million stg may become payable depending on results for next three financial years.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
